{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-corporate-clean-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b03", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "promise", "job": "orient", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.4, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 13, "facts": 2}, "why": "The empty outline is labelled single point of failure, then 3-2-1 is set large beside it.", "id": "b380c5b72ec3ec15", "at": "2026-10-14T11:59:15"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-corporate-clean-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b04", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "relate", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.7, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 16, "facts": 1}, "why": "Four failures arrive one at a time around the single report, each a small labelled mark that lands on its word and empties the file.", "id": "22ee005f44565ba8", "at": "2026-10-14T11:59:15"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-corporate-clean-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b05", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "define", "delivery": "slower on 'three'", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.8, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 16, "facts": 2}, "why": "The report copies twice into three files in a row; one is struck and two remain. The 3 lights.", "id": "7a4a3e7c18c383ed", "at": "2026-10-14T11:59:15"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "style-corporate-clean-qwen", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b06", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "define", "delivery": "slower on 'two'", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.8, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 19, "facts": 2}, "why": "A copy moves from the laptop to an external drive; a fault strikes the laptop only and the drive's copy stays whole. The 2 lights.", "id": "b181f2ae98b4d156", "at": "2026-10-14T11:59:15"}
